OL,3,GNEWSAVillage votes to 'leave UK' over  
OL,4,Amigrant plan                           
OL,6,FVillagers vowed "this is only the      
OL,7,Fbeginning" after voting overwhelmingly 
OL,8,Fto "leave the UK" in protest at plans  
OL,9,Fto house migrants at a former airbase. 
OL,11,FResidents in Barnham, Suffolk, held a  
OL,12,Fsymbolic poll on Saturday to decide    
OL,13,Fwhether or not to declare independence.
OL,15,FThe referendum was called after RAF    
OL,16,FBarnham, near Bury St Edmunds, Suffolk 
OL,17,Fand Thetford, in Norfolk, was earmarked
OL,18,Fby the government as a site to house up
OL,19,Fto 931 male asylum seekers.            
